l js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/755c074b3b20ca0b16d5835202d01c0b/3754bf5fd430dde5-d1/s640x960/db39f66db085f6e393db493bde50faa9a0fc2e51.pnj\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/755c074b3b20ca0b16d5835202d01c0b/3754bf5fd430dde5-d1/s640x960/db39f66db085f6e393db493bde50faa9a0fc2e51.pnj\" data-thumb-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/755c074b3b20ca0b16d5835202d01c0b/3754bf5fd430dde5-d1/s640x960/db39f66db085f6e393db493bde50faa9a0fc2e51.pnj\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <img data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15ae43b7602081e17fb169f349b85e31/3754bf5fd430dde5-7e/s640x960/4ed554547048fe084c0cc80a79ed4c2e2c5ad97c.pnj\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15ae43b7602081e17fb169f349b85e31/3754bf5fd430dde5-7e/s640x960/4ed554547048fe084c0cc80a79ed4c2e2c5ad97c.pnj\" data-thumb-url=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15ae43b7602081e17fb169f349b85e31/3754bf5fd430dde5-7e/s640x960/4ed554547048fe084c0cc80a79ed4c2e2c5ad97c.pnj\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> Source: <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/werewolfessentials/758186097516871680/for-todays-werewolf-wednesday-rather-than?source=share\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.tumblr.com/werewolfessen...n?source=share</a><br /> <br /> There's not much else to say that I haven't said before about this game on this forum and I'm a bit crap with summing up themes in media in general so I'll just leave it to the other users who are more qualified for it. <br /> <br /> I'm welling to post screen shot of the preview I've got if anyone is interested or if you aren't content to look at low resolutions pngs then you could get a copy of said preview by subscribing to the author's Ko-Fi: <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/songoftrillium\" target=\"_blank\">https://ko-fi.com/songoftrillium</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":7},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-09T09:37:39-07:00","id":1540089,"title":"","content":"So, to offer an idea what Werewolf the Essentials is; It takes the divided Nation from the BNS WtA book and builds upon it. It includes the Bitten, but so they do not override other breeds.<br /> <br /> The focus, as a direct challenge to W5, is of community and unity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-09T10:48:03-07:00","id":1540090,"title":"","content":"Wow! That's petty awesome! Thanks for the preview!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy