"count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-28T19:50:15-08:00","id":1546480,"title":"","content":"So Werewolf: the Essentials is going to release tomorrow assuming there isn't any delays. Anyone wants to share they thoughts about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-04-25T04:12:35-07:00","id":1550373,"title":"","content":"So uh yeah Contrary to my last post on this thread WtE isn't coming out it's actually delayed for about 6 moths now. Well there's an update on the project along with a preview for chapter 4 of the book that covers all 20 playable tribes in the book that's available for download on Mundus's Discord open to who subscribe to they ko-fi.<br /> <br /> Also I don't really have any good excuses on the late update beside it really slipping away from me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/779788123476525056?source=share\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/0105726eb5408e66720c7f3dad137521/d16b3f787c74f29b-6e/s640x960/148a253c7b0f900a17cc08848d8f4149f6ed7222.pnj\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/779788123476525056?source=share\" target=\"_blank\"> Post by @songoftrillium &middot; 1 image </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/779788123476525056?source=share\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.tumblr.com/songoftrillium/779788123476525056?source=share </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> \ud83d\udcac 0&nbsp;&nbsp;\ud83d\udd01 108&nbsp;&nbsp;\u2764\ufe0f 114&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;Likes don&rsquo;t increase visibility to others! Please reblog this to spread the word!&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;I think Werewolf is an inherently queer medium This is all a part of a larger long-term pro&hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Werewolf: the Essentials Project Update 04/02/2025<br /> Hello, Kinfolks. Woof. What a time to be alive. This is a period that\u2019s been reflected many, many times in the past under many different names. It seems like every time I pick up my phone there is always some new awful thing awaiting us. The intentional composition of the writers on this team are diverse and come from cultures across the world, and what ties us together has been our queerness, our passion for Werewolf, and our commitment to let our passions fuel our writing. The result has been a product that shows the passion from one page to the next.<br /> <br /> In short, the state of the world has impacted the pace at which we\u2019re working on the book. The priority right now is survival, and surviving is the task that has consumed most of the attentions of those helping with W:tE. It should come as no surprise that people who passionately care about Werewolf also care about the world around them at large, and that is exactly what many of us are doing.<br /> <br /> All the same, what\u2019s agreed between everyone on the team is that we all feel the work we\u2019re doing matters, and in many ways it can be a good way to keep one busy when the other option is the good-old doomscroll. And so, work is still happening, and beyond that, its starting to pick up again.<br /> <br /> So, what work remains?<br /> <br /> Writing<br /> Writing is more or less finished. Editing is ongoing and as small issues or missing mechanics come up we\u2019ve been working them in. Chapters 1-7 are complete, and Chapter 8, our storytelling and chronicle section, is in its last few pages before calling it done. We have a small number of writers still working on this, and so far we\u2019re looking at 100 Rite of Passage Story Seeds, and 40-60 Cliath Story Seeds. All in all we\u2019re handing Storytellers enough game material to be able to keep their tables plenty busy for at least a year of weekly game sessions. Also as a spitball number, by the time this book hits shelves we are looking to be at around 450 pages.<br /> <br /> Layout<br /> We are at the 75% complete mark! Chapter 6 of 8 is underway. Due to an influx of support, we\u2019re able to have one of our editors pick up work on a more daily basis, so this process should similarly be speeding up in the immediate future. It always feels like the work is neverending, but slowly and surely we\u2019re making progress. I\u2019ve promised myself once this book enters preflight I\u2019m taking a long vacation.<br /> <br /> Now, onto the fun stuff:<br /> <br /> New W:tE Preview - Meet the Gaians!<br /> With our full tribe writeups completed, we\u2019re happy to entice you with a new preview. For those ko-fi subscribers on the Fostern tier or above, you can now read not just our society and history dives, but can now see all the new tribes as written for Werewolf: the Essentials! This massive 80 page preview encompasses all twenty tribes of Gaians represented in Gulaka'i including background, territories, patron, and an all-new cultural outlook section! </div> </div> </div>Here's a of said tribes sorted by the faction they belonged in.<br /> <br /> <b>Eastern Concordat </b>(the progressive tribes of the nation)<ul><li>Black Furies (now with less misandry)</li> <li>Bone Gnawers (one of the two tribes conformed to lose all they cearns, they getting along fine in the short term.)</li> <li>Children of Gaia (and the stargazers since they joined after the apocalypse)</li> <li>Shadow Lords (Scheming For the grater good of gaia)</li> </ul><br /> <b>Western Concordat</b> (the traditionalist tribes of the nation)<ul><li>Get of Fenris (are not nazis)</li> <li>Glass Walkers (are currently doing IT all the Western Concordat)</li> <li>Silver Fangs (Currently down a high king, with Jason &quot;The Wyldstorm Rider&quot; Wyrmfoe acting the as Steward in case A) another Candide high king presents them selves or b) his frather turns out to be alive. Though since the last time anybody seen him is he sealing himself and a superbane in the deep umbra, so death would arguably be a better outcome\u200b\u200b\u200b)</li> <li>Skysingers (renamed Fennia who's the keeper of graou traditions, for good or bad)</li> </ul><br /> <b>Dawn Tribes</b> (the North America version of the beast tribes)<ul><li>Balam (werejagurs whose philosophical views on life and death kinda saddle them with the stereotype of being creepy nihilists or furry Euthanatos )</li> <li>Hapil (older brother who are still the usual tribe of of mystics and Bane Tenders.)</li> <li>Hatha (Pacific North west Gurahl whose jobs are now much easer since half of the garou nation wants to make up mistakes. the other half is busy with they own problems)</li> <li>Hearthbound (pro kinfolk rights activist group turned tribe)</li> <li>Kahaila (a tribe of Mokol\u00e9 who mainly takes the form of turtles and also the reason why most tribes still can make cearns)</li> <li>Kalaril (younger brother whose heart has thawed enough that welling entertain asking the other tribes for help... But still remember they ancestors sins)</li> <li>Nuwisha (wereCoyotes that are still pranksters of gaia)</li> <li>Pumonca (werepumas are experts in wilderness survival)</li> <li>Qualmi (werelynx riddle masters of gaia so the slightly more tolrable than the Nuwisha)</li> <li>Qularil (Pacific North west Corax)</li> </ul><b>Independent</b><ul><li>Red Talons (the second tribe that lacks any cearn and they arent dealing with it as well as they urban brothers)</li> <li>Silent Striders\u200b (Working to reconnect the nation while dealing with ghosts like BRIDGES without the babes in the bottle...)</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-12T01:24:32-08:00","id":1555393,"title":"","content":"So The WtE has just released a FAQ from for any questions any pontental ST and players would have.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/werewolfessentials.bsky.social/post/3m4vq62dlr22b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:k277talh6qadvlrvhz5a377p/bafkreidfdemelxkbfi22c2v2j5pzj6gpamoupvao2durmsy7jkknjicjoq\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/werewolfessentials.bsky.social/post/3m4vq62dlr22b\" target=\"_blank\"> Werewolf: the Essentials (@werewolfessentials.bsky.social) </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/werewolfessentials.bsky.social/post/3m4vq62dlr22b\" target=\"_blank\"> https://bsky.app/profile/werewolfessentials.bsky.social/post/3m4vq62dlr22b </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hey Kinfolk, It's Werewolf Wed, a perfect day for an update on WtE! We've been fielding quite a few questions over the months, so we though it might be worthwhile to start an FAQ. Click here to find out why we set the game in the PNW or changed some terms &amp; names. https://docs.google.com/document/d/15OJ8QPGWLUxqG798jwF4SRa8ELIadFrgv1LQbR_b_iI/ </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Hey Kinfolk, It's Werewolf Wed, a perfect day for an update on WtE!<br /> <br /> We've been fielding quite a few questions over the months, so we though it might be worthwhile to start an FAQ.<br /> <br /> Click here to find out why we set the game in the PNW or changed some terms &amp; names.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15OJ8QPGWLUxqG798jwF4SRa8ELIadFrgv1LQbR_b_iI/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15OJ8QPGWLUxqG798jwF4SRa8ELIadFrgv1LQbR_b_iI/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15OJ8QPGWLUxqG798jwF4SRa8ELIadFrgv1LQbR_b_iI/edit?tab=t.0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/15OJ8QPGWLUxqG798jwF4SRa8ELIadFrgv1LQbR_b_iI/edit?tab=t.0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"